SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 Singapore time: i Light Singapore 2027 Open Call: li
 ght art installations for Marina Bay (budget up to SGD 18\,000 per artwork
 \, theme: Resonance)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Dec 2026 at 23:59 Singapore time.\n\ni Light Singapor
 e\, the light festival run by Singapore's Urban Redevelopment Authority si
 nce 2010\, is commissioning light art installations for its 13th edition a
 round Marina Bay. WHO: artists and collectives whose country of representa
 tion or legal residence is in Asia\, including architects\, lighting\, pro
 duct and industrial designers\, artists and multimedia specialists.\n\nOrg
 anisation: i Light Singapore (Urban Redevelopment Authority\, managed by P
 ico Art International)\nLocation: Marina Bay\, Singapore. For artists and 
 collectives whose country of representation or legal residence is within A
 sia.\nAward: Artwork budget capped at SGD 18\,000 per selected installatio
 n\, covering artist and design fee\, production\, certification\, manpower
  and (for overseas artists) withholding tax. On top of that the festival c
 overs return sea freight\, insurance\, venue and approvals\, general maint
 enance and security\, and airfare plus accommodation for one person for up
  to 5 days. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Festival 4 to 27 June
  2027\n\nMore: https://www.ilightsingapore.gov.sg/about/2027-open-call/?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.ilightsingapore.gov.sg/about/2027-open-call/?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Marina Bay\, Singapore. For artists and collectives whose country 
 of representation or legal residence is within Asia.
END:VEVENT
